{"id": 8258532409542, "title": "Momcozy Colostrum Reusable Breast Milk Collector", "body_html": "<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>What is Colostrum? </strong>- In the pregnancy around 33-37 weeks and within 3-5 days after delivery, the mother will shed a few drops or small colostrum. It's rich in nutrients, high in protein. Newborns easily absorb it and plays a vital role in the baby's early growth.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Easy to Use </strong>- 5ml cylindrical design improves collector efficiency. Squeeze gently to create a stronger negative pressure effect and collect it through the nib, or remove the nib to directly collect the squeezed colostrum and cover it after collection. (Follow storage guidelines to store and freeze) Simply squeeze the colostrum dropper during feeding to deliver liquid gold to your newborn.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Reliable &amp; Multi-Use</strong> - Ready-to-use. Momcozy colostrum collector set replaces traditional plastic colostrum syringes, it's made of BPA-free food-grade silicone and is reusable, ensuring quality and safety. It can be used to collect, store, feed colostrum, and also be used as a pet feeding/medicine dropper/plant dropper/travel container/DIY tool, etc.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>What Will You Gain?</strong> - Momcozy colostrum collector 6-pack set comes wit 5ml/0.17oz silicone collectors*6 (sealed ready-to-use packaging), label stickers*6, cleaning cotton cloth*1, portable storage box*1 and cleaning brush *1. Ready to use after opening without cleaning, and use cotton cloth to clean breast before and after collection. Colostrum is usually only produced for a few days, don't miss it.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Easy to Clean &amp; Care</strong> - Please boil it in water for 2-3 minutes to clean after use, use a included cleaning brush to clean without dead corners. Store it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Please discard any remaining colostrum in the container after each feeding to keep it fresh and quality.</span></p>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Accessories", "created_at": "2024-07-04T05:53:06-04:00", "handle": "momcozy-colostrum-reusable-breast-milk-collector", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:09-04:00", "published_at": "2024-07-04T05:53:06-04:00", "template_suffix": "bp-colostrum-reusable", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "Breastfeeding supplies, 储奶收集, 吸奶器, 吸奶器小品, 小品主链", "variants": [{"id": 43928742527174, "product_id": 8258532409542, "title": "6 Count", "price": "16.99", "sku": "BC008-NA72NB-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "19.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "6 Count", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2024-07-04T05:53:06-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:09-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "812421620344", "grams": 50, "image_id": 42792043577542, "weight": 0.0499, "weight_unit": "kg", "tax_code": "", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_rule": {"min": 1, "max": null, "increment": 1}, "price_currency": "USD", "compare_at_price_currency": "USD", "quantity_price_breaks": []}, {"id": 43928742559942, "product_id": 8258532409542, "title": "12 Count", "price": "35.99", "sku": "BC008-NA73NB-A", "position": 2, "compare_at_price": "36.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "12 Count", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2024-07-04T05:53:06-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:09-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "81242162027", "grams": 50, "image_id": 42791648166086, "weight": 0.0499, "weight_unit": "kg", "tax_code": "", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_rule": {"min": 1, "max": null, "increment": 1}, "price_currency": "USD", "compare_at_price_currency": "USD", "quantity_price_breaks": []}], "options": [{"id": 10338555396294, "product_id": 8258532409542, "name": "size", "position": 1, "values": ["6 Count", "12 Cou